  },
  {
    label: 'Data analyst',
    tag: 'Highest tool-skill ceiling',
    body: 'You clean data, build queries, and turn numbers into a story a manager can act on. The best entry point is one real, finished project you can walk someone through end to end.',
    fit: 'Fit: you enjoy patterns in numbers and do not mind a genuine, sustained learning curve on SQL and a BI tool.',
    watch: 'Watch out: a certificate with no project attached gets filtered out fast in screening rounds.',
