  <h2 id="skill-track">Business analyst, data analyst, and digital marketing: the skill-first track</h2>

  <p>
    If a multi-year exam grind genuinely does not fit your situation, this cluster is the
    fastest-moving entry option for commerce graduates right now, and it is the one placement cells
    mention least.
  </p>

  <div class="skill-cards-grid">
